00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:22.540
Worry.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.980
Dondalora will take care of that.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.970
Raymond usually attends the afternoon services of the...

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:54.110
on without me. I want to stay and visit with the Padre. We'll wait for you if you wish. No thanks.

